{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Maybe she'd </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="たた">roused</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> him from his sleep. His eyes were bleary, and he still smelled a little of drink...</STYLE><PG>
